# Local flashing configuration. Both carry a hex path and, for CM3WSD, a COM
# port that differ per machine, so they are kept out and seeded from the
# .example files beside them:
#
#   cp jlc.cfg.example jlc.cfg
#   cp tools/SerialDownloader/CM3WSD/cm3wsd.ini.example \
#      tools/SerialDownloader/CM3WSD/cm3wsd.ini
#
# CM3WSD rewrites its ini on exit, which is the other reason to keep it
# untracked: it would otherwise show up dirty after every flashing session.
/jlc.cfg
/tools/SerialDownloader/CM3WSD/cm3wsd.ini
